window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Beck Wolffbrandt is not good for me—he's not good period.</p> <p>He is unhinged; without abandon. His darkness calls to the depraved parts of me, relieving me of all rational thought processes.</p> <p>I can't help but want all the things he thinks he can't offer me.</p> <p>My pursuit of him quickly morphs into a dangerous game I'm not sure either of us can win.</p> <p>I'm willing to risk everything to show him what we could be.</p> <p>Including my life.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
